{
  "song_id": 3778,
  "title": "Modern Day Mugging",
  "language": "en",
  "lyricists": [
    45940,
    70
  ],
  "lyrics": [
    {
      "section_id": "section_0",
      "type": "intro",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Viktor Vaughn",
          "rhyme": "2n",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "You are accused of --",
          "rhyme": "Of",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "(ahahahahah)",
          "rhyme": null,
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Fool! Did you really think Viktor Vaughn could be captured so easily?",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "We have a suspect, we have a witness",
          "rhyme": "Es",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "But we have no Vik see if you can authorize overtime",
          "rhyme": "im",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme": "ABCDEF",
      "rhyme_vowel": "ABCDED"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_1",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "He used to get straight A's",
          "rhyme": "ins",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Nowadays, \"Get way paid\" is the pet phrase",
          "rhyme": "az",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "Set the stage, preferably night-times",
          "rhyme": "im",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Daylight reserved for research and writin' rhymes",
          "rhyme": "im",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "Things is harder than the tarnish on the garnets",
          "rhyme": "E",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "In his gold teeth to eat, goshdarn it, V hold heat",
          "rhyme": "at",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "Goin' all out to the fullest, all dipped",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "Chrome four-fiddith, no bullets no clip",
          "rhyme": "ip",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "Black electric tape over the hole in the handle",
          "rhyme": "9dl",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "If you hold it right and hit 'em with it they can't tell",
          "rhyme": "El",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "But still, you got to be careful",
          "rhyme": "9l",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "Dudes be so scared, they cop pleas by the earfull",
          "rhyme": "ul",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "12",
          "text": "V personal fave is, \"Please don't kill me\"",
          "rhyme": "@",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "13",
          "text": "Empty out your pockets and he probably won't, willy",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "14",
          "text": "But if you don't hurry up and shut up, I'll kill ya",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "15",
          "text": "Now lay down and count to a hundred loud, will ya?",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "16",
          "text": "When the nickel gleam like it's greased up",
          "rhyme": "9p",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "17",
          "text": "Thugs turn to icicles, hard rocks freezed up",
          "rhyme": "9p",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "18",
          "text": "This could all be a distraction just to buy time to blast you",
          "rhyme": "u",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "19",
          "text": "So keep something to cut in case you has to",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "20",
          "text": "If he was on the Island, he'd probably rob The Millionaire",
          "rhyme": "ER",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "21",
          "text": "And be known for wildin' out like Bob Dylan hair",
          "rhyme": "ER",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "22",
          "text": "These clever war tips",
          "rhyme": "ip",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "23",
          "text": "You won't get from cats who never wore skips",
          "rhyme": "ip",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "24",
          "text": "Now, let's get down to brass tacks",
          "rhyme": "ak",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "25",
          "text": "Follow procedure and count stacks like NASDAQ",
          "rhyme": "ak",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "26",
          "text": "*snoring* Don't be caught snoozin'",
          "rhyme": ")",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "27",
          "text": "In the early morning hours from a long night of boozing",
          "rhyme": "iN",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "28",
          "text": "Stick 'em up, chump, you know what this is",
          "rhyme": "E",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "29",
          "text": "Do the right thing, you might live to see your kids",
          "rhyme": "id",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "30",
          "text": "All he said was, \"Come on, don't shoot!\"",
          "rhyme": "ut",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "31",
          "text": "So shook, I think he shit his Sean John suit",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "32",
          "text": "Why you starin'? (Huh?) Run your chain like an errand",
          "rhyme": "#",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "33",
          "text": "And your girl's earrings (Oh shit), and what y'all wearin'",
          "rhyme": ")",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "34",
          "text": "Survival tactics for when things get too gritty",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "35",
          "text": "He feels it's his duty to the people of the city",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "36",
          "text": "Just so long as nobody get hurt",
          "rhyme": "uRt",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "37",
          "text": "It keep the average civilian on point and alert",
          "rhyme": "ER",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "38",
          "text": "And don't forget to check her D-cup",
          "rhyme": "yp",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "39",
          "text": "Now I bust how he got this duck for his re-up",
          "rhyme": "9p",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "40",
          "text": "Then he's back on the bricks, smokin' indo'",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "41",
          "text": "Never let a handy fiend fix your broken window",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "42",
          "text": "Oh, wanna hate the witty lurker?",
          "rhyme": "9R",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "43",
          "text": "Who follow y'all on the late, dressed like a city worker",
          "rhyme": "9R",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "44",
          "text": "OK, miss, come up off that bracelet",
          "rhyme": "E",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "45",
          "text": "Just got your hair did, don't make me waste it",
          "rhyme": "it",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "46",
          "text": "So, go to Hades, get the Devil for his stash",
          "rhyme": "aS",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "47",
          "text": "But no old ladies unless you're sure they carry mad cash",
          "rhyme": "aS",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "48",
          "text": "Like the one from the liquor store",
          "rhyme": "OR",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "49",
          "text": "He watched her for weeks now, ready for the quick score",
          "rhyme": "OR",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "50",
          "text": "Before he told her, \"Whore, get on the floor\"",
          "rhyme": "OR",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "51",
          "text": "She pulled out and let off like Quick Draw McGraw (Oh, shit!)",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "52",
          "text": "Damn yo, he lucky, she barely nicked the camo",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "53",
          "text": "He would've let her have it if he had the ammo",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "54",
          "text": "It's all in good fun, true, moral of the story, son duke",
          "rhyme": "Ejk",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "55",
          "text": "Senior citizens'll bust their guns too!",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme": "ABCCDEFGHIJKLMNNOOPQRRGGSSTUDVWMXTMMYRZOQQ[[D\\]]^^^QQQ_Q",
      "rhyme_vowel": "ABAACBDAECEFGABBEEFHCCAABBIACAFAJIAAFCKEHHEECABBLLLHHHCH"
    }
  ]
